# IceQ — Docker build-context exclusions
#
# Build contexts: Caddy/web (deploy/Dockerfile.caddy) and Go services
# (backend/*/Dockerfile) all use the repository root as context.
#
# RULES OF THUMB:
#   - Never include real secrets, credentials, or environment files.
#   - Never include AI/editor/OS development-tool directories.
#   - Never include node_modules, dist, coverage, or test artifacts.
#   - Keep everything needed for `npm ci && npm run build` and `go build`.

# ── Version control ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.github

# ── Secrets and environment ──────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
deploy/.env
deploy/.env.*

# ── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules
web/node_modules

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist
web/dist
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Test and coverage artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────
coverage
*.coverage
web/coverage
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/playwright/.cache
*.out

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs

# ── Temporary and editor files ───────────────────────────────────────
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.temp

# ── OS metadata ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__MACOSX
